{"id":"4f2c4a3e09c03374","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-canonical-successor.md","title":"Canonical Successor Witness","display":"lem-canonical-successor — Canonical Successor Witness","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-canonical-successor","aliases":["89-lem-canonical-successor"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-canonical-successor — Canonical Successor Witness","depends_on":["[[89-df-canonical-model]]","[[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]]","[[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]]","[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-canonical-successor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-canonical-successor</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-canonical-successor — Canonical Successor Witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c922518c30c4107d\" href=\"?note=c922518c30c4107d\" title=\"89-df-canonical-model\">89-df-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"646a96fe655f6d74\" href=\"?note=646a96fe655f6d74\" title=\"89-lem-lindenbaum-modal\">89-lem-lindenbaum-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"92c4449a6fa3b997\" href=\"?note=92c4449a6fa3b997\" title=\"89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties\">89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7c0e4d58dc068222\" href=\"?note=7c0e4d58dc068222\" title=\"89-lem-normal-box-lifting\">89-lem-normal-box-lifting</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin L\">\\(\\bot\\notin L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_L=(W_L,R_L,V_L)\">\\(\\mathcal M_L=(W_L,R_L,V_L)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in W_L\">\\(\\Gamma\\in W_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_L\\)</span> 为局部一致性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\Box B\\notin\\Gamma\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\\mathrm{Con}_L\\bigl(\\{C\\mid C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Box C\\in\\Gamma\\}\\cup\\{\\neg B\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists\\Delta\\in W_L\\;(\\Gamma R_L\\Delta\\land\\neg B\\in\\Delta)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\Box B\\notin\\Gamma\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\\mathrm{Con}_L\\bigl(\\{C\\mid C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Box C\\in\\Gamma\\}\\cup\\{\\neg B\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists\\Delta\\in W_L\\;(\\Gamma R_L\\Delta\\land\\neg B\\in\\Delta)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 86–87；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>若所示集合不一致，有限见证经命题重排得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\bigwedge_i C_i\\to B)\\in L\">\\((\\bigwedge_i C_i\\to B)\\in L\\)</span>，其中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box C_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\Box C_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i\">\\(C_i\\)</span> 时取空合取。盒提升给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\bigwedge_i\\Box C_i\\to\\Box B)\\in L\">\\((\\bigwedge_i\\Box C_i\\to\\Box B)\\in L\\)</span>，极大一致性闭包迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box B\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\Box B\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>，矛盾。Lindenbaum 扩张该一致集合得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span>，它满足关系定义并包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg B\">\\(\\neg B\\)</span>。本引理对所有一致正常逻辑成立，不使用 GL 的逆良基性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"c922518c30c4107d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-lindenbaum-modal","status":"resolved","id":"646a96fe655f6d74","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties","status":"resolved","id":"92c4449a6fa3b997","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-normal-box-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"7c0e4d58dc068222","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\notin L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_L=(W_L,R_L,V_L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in W_L","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\Box B\\notin\\Gamma\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\\mathrm{Con}_L\\bigl(\\{C\\mid C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Box C\\in\\Gamma\\}\\cup\\{\\neg B\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists\\Delta\\in W_L\\;(\\Gamma R_L\\Delta\\land\\neg B\\in\\Delta)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"(\\bigwedge_i C_i\\to B)\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box C_i\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"C_i","display":false},{"tex":"(\\bigwedge_i\\Box C_i\\to\\Box B)\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box B\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg B","display":false}],"bytes":1475,"backlinks":[{"id":"5ba20ee86fa7998c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]] → [[89-df-local-modal-consequence]] → [[89-lem-local-modal-deduction]] → [[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]] → [[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]] → [[89-df-canonical-model]] → [[89-lem-canonical-successor]] → [[89-lem-canonical-truth]] → [[89-thm-canonical-model]]"}],"outgoing":["c922518c30c4107d","646a96fe655f6d74","92c4449a6fa3b997","7c0e4d58dc068222"]}